  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The reference open-source zero-footprint DICOM viewer — 4.2k stars, foundation governance (OHIF), NIH/NCI ITCR funded, and widely embedded in research and clinical infrastructure including NCI Imaging Data Commons. MIT licensed. Supports the full imaging workflow from 2D/3D rendering and MPR to segmentation, structured reports, and whole slide microscopy. The default choice for institutions building web-based imaging viewers on open-source foundations.",
